  "$id": "https://github.com/jusso-dev/hermes-cyber-au/tests/fixtures/misp/misp-core-event.schema.json",
  "title": "MISP core format event (subset used by the cyber-au MISP export)",
  "description": "Derived from draft-dulaunoy-misp-core-format (MISP/misp-rfc, misp-core-format/raw.md, commit b10f23ac9eb9bf79867f1f3b413adcd396e21b79). See README.md in this directory.",
